{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 5291332,
  "courseSlug": "chatgpt-bard-bing-complete-guide-to-chatgpt-openai-apis",
  "courseTitle": "ChatGPT & Generative AI - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37781116",
      "title": "Your Prompts & Images are Public!",
      "sourceHash": "6437fd32b70843cade0f35fd74358575667cc7a8f24319dfcb6330832b1a8458",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 2.963,
          "en": "We learned that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.963,
          "end": 5.85,
          "en": "we can use Midjourney in two ways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.85,
          "end": 9.27,
          "en": "We can either use it in this Public channel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.27,
          "end": 11.73,
          "en": "so in this newbies channel, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.73,
          "end": 14.431,
          "en": "which has the biggest disadvantage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.431,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "that it's a bit less organized,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 19.593,
          "en": "and that everybody can see our prompts and images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.76,
          "end": 24.84,
          "en": "Alternatively, we can go to our direct messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.84,
          "end": 28.38,
          "en": "and add our prompts and images in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.38,
          "end": 33.06,
          "en": "With that, nobody else can see our information so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.06,
          "end": 36.18,
          "en": "This is not entirely true though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.18,
          "end": 39.9,
          "en": "because inside Discord, indeed nobody can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 41.583,
          "en": "what we are creating in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.42,
          "end": 44.64,
          "en": "But actually all your images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.64,
          "end": 46.41,
          "en": "and therefore also all your prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.41,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "are publicly available outside of Discord.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 53.37,
          "en": "Because remember, Discord is only the interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.37,
          "end": 56.79,
          "en": "we use to provide our prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.79,
          "end": 59.943,
          "en": "But the actual Midjourney page is a lot bigger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.17,
          "end": 64.05,
          "en": "And this is where this Public Mode button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.05,
          "end": 65.283,
          "en": "comes into play.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 68.13,
          "en": "Depending on your plan,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.13,
          "end": 71.7,
          "en": "you can switch from public to private mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 74.22,
          "en": "I, in my case, have the standard plan,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.22,
          "end": 75.843,
          "en": "so if I try to switch here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.19,
          "end": 80.43,
          "en": "I get the information that my current membership plan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 83.13,
          "en": "doesn't include this private mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.13,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "So we have to switch to a more expansive plan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 88.32300000000001,
          "en": "to have access to this private mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "I won't do that here because instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.65,
          "end": 94.11,
          "en": "I wanna show you where your prompts and images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.11,
          "end": 96.512,
          "en": "can be seen by other people.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.512,
          "end": 101.512,
          "en": "And for this, we can go to one of our upscaled images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.68,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "up here, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 107.913,
          "en": "And now select this Web option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 112.473,
          "en": "With that, we can visit the Midjourney website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.6,
          "end": 118.74000000000001,
          "en": "and in here now we can simply go to sign in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.74000000000001,
          "end": 122.1,
          "en": "So we first join the beta to be able to use Midjourney",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.1,
          "end": 123.9,
          "en": "with our Discord account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.9,
          "end": 128.25,
          "en": "Now we sign in to access our accounts information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.25,
          "end": 131.19,
          "en": "from the Midjourney server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.19,
          "end": 134.677,
          "en": "So with authorized, we are now redirected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.06,
          "end": 140.103,
          "en": "to that specific image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.12,
          "end": 142.77,
          "en": "And there we can also find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.77,
          "end": 145.022,
          "en": "our prompt down here for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.022,
          "end": 148.052,
          "en": "But if we go to our homepage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.052,
          "end": 153.052,
          "en": "you can find all our Grids and Upscales.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.78,
          "end": 156.81,
          "en": "By default Upscales are selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.81,
          "end": 158.583,
          "en": "you can also switch to your Grids,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.14,
          "end": 163.56,
          "en": "and also see all your Grids and Upscales",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.56,
          "end": 166.2,
          "en": "that you created in Discord.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.2,
          "end": 170.04,
          "en": "Well, nothing too bad about that, that's just my profile.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.04,
          "end": 173.67000000000002,
          "en": "But in the explore area here, you can find the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.67000000000002,
          "end": 175.473,
          "en": "so-called Community Feed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 180.36,
          "en": "And in this feed you can find lots and lots of images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.36,
          "end": 183.15,
          "en": "Now the funny thing is that, as the name indicates,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.15,
          "end": 186.21,
          "en": "this Community Feed contains real images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.21,
          "end": 191.01,
          "en": "created by the community, not by the Midjourney team.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 194.52,
          "en": "And this is what this public mode is all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 198.42000000000002,
          "en": "Whenever you use a prompt and create an image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.42000000000002,
          "end": 201.87,
          "en": "no matter if it's a direct message or a public channel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 201.87,
          "end": 204.45,
          "en": "the prompt and the image will be available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 204.45,
          "end": 205.743,
          "en": "in the Community Feed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.94,
          "end": 209.55,
          "en": "If you have the option to activate the private mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 209.55,
          "end": 210.69,
          "en": "this is not the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.69,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "But all your other images will be displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 216.78300000000002,
          "en": "and can be found here in the Community Feed.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
      "lectureOrder": 165,
      "videoOrder": 165
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
